 ademic Calendar. Tentative hurricane make-up dates are currently planned w
 ithout student classes and may be activated. Early release applies to inst
 ructional Mondays\, plus the final Friday. The verified bell-time row cove
 rs Riverview High School only\, effective September 10\, 2026. Confirm cal
 endars for charter schools and separate programs directly.
